

========== 第7章の補足 電源を抜いた次の起動と、再起動の記録 ==========

# --- 画面の写し: 端末1: 書いてすぐに電源を抜かれる ---
$ echo "抜く前に書いた" > memo.txt; ls -l memo.txt
-rw-rw-r-- 1 student student 22 Oct 13 19:30 memo.txt
$ Connection to 127.0.0.1 closed by remote host.
Connection to 127.0.0.1 closed.
$

# --- ここまで ---

# --- 画面の写し: 外: 動いている練習機を destroy して、また起動する ---
$ virsh destroy linuc
Domain 'linuc' destroyed

$ virsh start linuc
Domain 'linuc' started

$

# --- ここまで ---

# --- 画面の写し: 電源を抜かれた次の起動 ---
$ sudo cat /run/initramfs/fsck.log
Log of fsck -C -a -V -t ext4 /dev/vda1
Tue Oct 13 10:31:14 2026

fsck from util-linux 2.39.3
[/usr/sbin/fsck.ext4 (1) -- /dev/vda1] fsck.ext4 -a -C0 /dev/vda1
cloudimg-rootfs: recovering journal
cloudimg-rootfs: clean, 31930/2490368 files, 431007/4980475 blocks

Tue Oct 13 10:31:14 2026
----------------
$ ls -l memo.txt; cat memo.txt
ls: cannot access 'memo.txt': No such file or directory
cat: memo.txt: No such file or directory
$

# --- ここまで ---

# --- 画面の写し: sudo reboot ---
$ cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/boot_id
19186b57-efbc-48cd-a458-622572354c78
$ sudo reboot

Broadcast message from root@linuc on pts/1 (Tue 2026-10-13 19:31:49 JST):

The system will reboot now!

$ Connection to 127.0.0.1 closed by remote host.
Connection to 127.0.0.1 closed.
$

# --- ここまで ---

# --- 画面の写し: reboot の後 ---
$ cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/boot_id
58b2c094-2ef8-4e45-baa5-889dbd24f2a2
$ last -x reboot shutdown | head -8
reboot   system boot  6.8.0-142-generi Tue Oct 13 19:32   still running
shutdown system down  6.8.0-142-generi Tue Oct 13 19:32 - 19:32  (00:00)
