shutdown system down  6.8.0-142-generi Tue Oct 13 19:26 - 19:27  (00:00)
reboot   system boot  6.8.0-142-generi Tue Oct 13 19:26 - 19:26  (00:00)
reboot   system boot  6.8.0-142-generi Tue Oct 13 19:24 - 19:26  (00:01)
